    "methods_description": "Participants made speeded left/right localization responses to voices with a keyboard while fixating a central cross. Highly and weakly amplitude-modulated (highAM/lowAM) voices served as CS+ or CS-, with assignment counterbalanced by voice gender across participants. The unpleasant white noise US was delivered with 50% partial reinforcement during Conditioning. EEG, pupillometry, and behavioral measures (valence, arousal, response time, hit rate) were recorded.",
